{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And they shall bring.</b> To YHWH — for the glory of YHWH, that they may fear." "<b>In chariots.</b> Of iron." "<b>And in wagons.</b> They are the carts: six carts (Numbers 7:3) צב." "<b>And in swift beasts.</b> Like שלחו כר (Isaiah 16:1), and it is a noble species of camel, and the word is doubled." "<b>As.</b> Israel would bring the meal-offering, lest it become impure."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 66, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:01:18.393018893Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}